 ## Background
-The method is described in the context of the `fV-SRN` project, which uses CUDA and OpenGL for volume rendering [S1, unofficial]. It is part of a larger renderer library that supports various volume formats and compression techniques. The project targets NVIDIA RTX GPUs and uses Python for configuration and training integration [S1, unofficial].
